{"ID":"20240513083036-cogk4kl","Spec":"2","Type":"NodeDocument","Properties":{"custom-sy-readonly":"true","id":"20240513083036-cogk4kl","scroll":"\u0026#123;\u0026quot;rootId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240513083036-cogk4kl\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;startId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240513170134-qmkf9z6\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;endId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240513170134-qmkf9z6\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;scrollTop\u0026quot;:345,\u0026quot;focusId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240513170134-qmkf9z6\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;focusStart\u0026quot;:605,\u0026quot;focusEnd\u0026quot;:645\u0026#125;","title":"270","type":"doc","updated":"20240514170327"},"Children":[{"ID":"20240513170134-qmkf9z6","Type":"NodeTable","TableAligns":[0],"Properties":{"colgroup":"width: 730px;","id":"20240513170134-qmkf9z6","updated":"20240514170327"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableHead","Data":"thead","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"th","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"倪醫師病案紀錄"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 初診日期：2008/03/19"}]}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"姓名"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"208 L, CM"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"性別"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"F"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"年齡及體型"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"35/胖"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"來診日期"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"2008/03/19"}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"來診原因："},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"曾有兩年無月經來(因來美國，有壓力)，之前經期正常，現一個半月或兩個月一行("},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"師：心臟火力不夠，奶水無法下達子宮"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":")想減重，心口時悶，雙環跳痛、兩側膀胱經痛(虛證)"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"問診："},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"1、 "},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"睡眠："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"好 "},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"2、大便："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"每日行"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"3、小便："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"淡白，次數多，每次量少"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"4、口渴："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"有，喜溫飲"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"5、胃口："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"好"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"6、手足溫度："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"自覺身熱、手熱，但睡覺時會將腳蓋起來，看電視時，腳會一下子就冰起來。"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"7、掌額溫度："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"手溫額涼。"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"8、問汗："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"運動也不易出汗"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"9、體力："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"早上起床體力差，不易醒"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"10、其他："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"常常需要深呼吸"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"("},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"師：因其表水未透發，毛孔未全開，深呼吸以幫助呼吸"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":")。氣溫改變時，皮膚會癢("},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"師：此亦與表水未透發有關，另其小便次數多，量少，亦與此相關；此外，因表水未透發，毛孔未全開，其汗不易出，故其會有身體的寒熱變化，如自覺身熱，但睡覺時會將腳蓋起來等"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":")"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"脈診："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"脈緩"}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"望診：\n1、舌診："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"淡紅"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"診斷："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"表水未透發"}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"針灸處方："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"雙陰谷、委中、雙環跳"}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"中藥處方："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"桂枝四錢、白芍四錢、麻黃三錢、杏仁三錢、炙甘草三錢、大棗十枚、生薑二片(自切)"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"→桂枝麻黃各半湯，發微汗，將表水去掉。桂枝麻黃各半湯，身必癢，此乃表汗沒有發透，光用桂枝湯，力量達不到皮表，故要用麻黃。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"防己五錢、茯苓五錢"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"→若無法全得汗解，下防己、茯苓入三焦，使水可從小便走。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"10付 "},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"9→3 "},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"bf B、S"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"解說："},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"師：服此方後，會發微汗，故服後不要馬上出門，等確定汗出完了再出門，以免汗出當風。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"備註："}]}]}]}]}